## Files: 
- kallisto_bus.sh performs pseudoalignment and outputs a bus file for each fastq pair. Then sorts the bus file. The resulting bus files will be merged with bustools_merge. 
- bustools_merge.sh merges the bus files from the multiple fastq
- bustools_count

- kallisto_joint.sh does pseudoalignment on all fastq together. kallisto bus expects multiple fastq to be e.g. laneA_1.fastq laneA_2.fastq ... laneN_1.fastq laneN_2.fastq



